package(USEPKG LOKI G4GeoLoki G4CustomPyGen G4Interfaces G4Launcher G4CollectFilters G4MCPLPlugins Units USEEXT MCPL)

######################################################################

The AmBe neutron source in a cylindrical HDPE moderator, for LOKI simulations of
measurements with such a source (e.g. the detector test of October 2026, see
LokiCommissioning/DetectorTest2026October):

  sb_lokiambe_sim event_gen=ambe x_meters=.. y_meters=.. z_meters=.. [...]
  sb_lokiambe_simanachain <dir> event_gen=ambe [...]

python/AmBeSourceGen.py: the generator (neutrons leaving the moderator surface,
with the spectra and angular distributions of a table in data/).

The table is made with the moderator simulation (the bare AmBe source in the
HDPE cylinder, pymod__GeoModerator and python/AmBeModeratorGen.py):

  sb_lokiambe_moderatorsim ... --mcpl="RecordShell where trk.pdgcode==2112 to leak"
  sb_lokiambe_makespectrum LEAK NSOURCE OUT RADIUS_CM HEIGHT_CM

